IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `types`
IMPORT `chapter-4-exceptions`
IMPORT `chapter-4a-private-defence`

§ `Chapter 14 -- Public health and safety`

-- Penal Code 1871 ss 269, 270, 271, 272, 273, 274, 275, 276, 277, 278, 279, 280, 281,
-- 282, 283, 284, 285, 286, 287, 288, 289.
-- Source: registers/source-bundle/PC1871.txt.
--
-- The second of three modules for Chapter 14. Twenty-one sections in five families.
-- INFECTION (ss 269 to 271): an act likely to spread a disease dangerous to life,
-- done negligently (s 269) or intentionally or rashly (s 270), and disobeying a
-- quarantine rule (s 271). FOOD AND DRUGS (ss 272 to 276): adulterating food or
-- drink for sale, selling noxious food, adulterating drugs, selling adulterated
-- drugs, and selling one drug as another. WATER AND AIR (ss 277, 278). WAYS AND
-- NAVIGATION (ss 279 to 283): rash driving, rash navigation, a false light, an
-- unsafe vessel for hire, and danger or obstruction in a public way. And the six
-- RASH OR NEGLIGENT CONDUCT sections rewritten in 2019 (ss 284 to 289): a dangerous
-- substance, fire, machinery, a building being pulled down or repaired, and an
-- animal, each graded by consequence, with s 286's presumption for fire.
--
-- ss 284, 285, 287, 288 and 289 have the same shape: a rash or negligent act or
-- omission with the thing, and a ladder of consequences from likely hurt to death,
-- each rung a separate punishment. The offence is complete on any rung, so each
-- section's rule disjoins its rungs; the rung facts are shared across the five
-- sections and the punishment is not decided. s 284(2), s 287(2): "act" includes an
-- omission to take a sufficient guarding measure, which is inside the conduct fact.
-- s 284(4): "dangerous or harmful substance" includes fire, which is in the wording.
--
-- s 286 is a rebuttable presumption and has a rule: one who drops a cigarette,
-- match or ember in a place where a fire occurs within 60 minutes is presumed to have
-- substantially contributed to the risk, until the contrary is proved. It is a route
-- into s 285's contribution element, not a separate offence.
--
-- PUNISHMENT IS NOT COMPUTED.

§§ `Sections 269 to 271 -- Infection and quarantine`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 269"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes a negligent act likely to spread infection of a disease dangerous to life under Penal Code 1871 section 269
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc Unlawfully or negligently doing an act which is, and which the person knows or has reason to believe to be, likely to spread the infection of a disease dangerous to life.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes a negligent act likely to spread infection` IF
        ph's `does an act which is and which he knows or has reason to believe to be likely to spread the infection of a disease dangerous to life`
    AND ph's `the act is done unlawfully or negligently`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 270"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes an intentional or rash act likely to spread infection of a disease dangerous to life under Penal Code 1871 section 270
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc Intentionally or rashly doing such an act.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes an intentional or rash act likely to spread infection` IF
        ph's `does an act which is and which he knows or has reason to believe to be likely to spread the infection of a disease dangerous to life`
    AND ph's `the act is done intentionally or rashly`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 271"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes disobedience to a quarantine rule under Penal Code 1871 section 271
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc Knowingly disobeying a rule lawfully made and promulgated for quarantining a vessel, regulating quarantined vessels' contact with the shore or other vessels, or regulating intercourse between infected and other places.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes disobedience to a quarantine rule` IF
    ph's `knowingly disobeys a rule lawfully made and promulgated for putting a vessel into a state of quarantine or for regulating the intercourse of vessels in quarantine with the shore or with other vessels or for regulating the intercourse between places where an infectious disease prevails and other places`

§§ `Sections 272 to 276 -- Food, drink and drugs`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 272"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes adulteration of food or drink intended for sale under Penal Code 1871 section 272
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc Adulterating food or drink so as to make it noxious, intending to sell it as food or drink or knowing it likely to be so sold.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes adulterating food or drink for sale` IF
        ph's `adulterates an article of food or drink so as to make it noxious as food or drink`
    AND ph's `intends to sell the article as food or drink or knows it to be likely that it will be sold as food or drink`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 273"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes sale of noxious food or drink under Penal Code 1871 section 273
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc Selling, offering or exposing for sale as food or drink an article rendered or become noxious or unfit, knowing or having reason to believe it noxious.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes selling noxious food or drink` IF
        ph's `sells or offers or exposes for sale as food or drink an article which has been rendered or has become noxious or is in a state unfit for food or drink`
    AND ph's `knows or has reason to believe that the article is noxious as food or drink`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 274"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes adulteration of drugs under Penal Code 1871 section 274
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc Adulterating a drug or medical preparation so as to lessen its efficacy, change its operation or make it noxious, intending or knowing it likely to be sold or used medicinally as if unadulterated.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes adulterating drugs` IF
        ph's `adulterates a drug or medical preparation so as to lessen its efficacy or change its operation or make it noxious`
    AND ph's `intends that the drug or medical preparation be sold or used for or knows it to be likely that it will be sold or used for a medicinal purpose as if it had not undergone the adulteration`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 275"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes sale of adulterated drugs under Penal Code 1871 section 275
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc Knowing a drug or medical preparation to have been so adulterated, selling it, offering or exposing it for sale, issuing it from a dispensary as unadulterated, or causing it to be used medicinally by a person unaware of the adulteration.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes selling adulterated drugs` IF
        ph's `knows a drug or medical preparation to have been adulterated so as to lessen its efficacy change its operation or render it noxious`
    AND ph's `sells the adulterated drug or offers or exposes it for sale or issues it from a dispensary for medicinal purposes as unadulterated or causes it to be used for medicinal purposes by a person not knowing of the adulteration`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 276"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes sale of a drug as a different drug or preparation under Penal Code 1871 section 276
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc Knowingly selling, offering or exposing for sale, or issuing from a dispensary for medicinal purposes, a drug or medical preparation as a different one.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes selling a drug as a different drug` IF
    ph's `knowingly sells or offers or exposes for sale or issues from a dispensary for medicinal purposes a drug or medical preparation as a different drug or medical preparation`

§§ `Sections 277 and 278 -- Water and atmosphere`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 277"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes fouling the water of a public spring or reservoir under Penal Code 1871 section 277
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc Voluntarily corrupting or fouling the water of a public spring or reservoir so as to make it less fit for its ordinary purpose.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes fouling a public spring or reservoir` IF
    ph's `voluntarily corrupts or fouls the water of a public spring or reservoir so as to render it less fit for the purpose for which it is ordinarily used`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 278"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes making the atmosphere noxious to health under Penal Code 1871 section 278
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc Voluntarily vitiating the atmosphere in a place so as to make it noxious to the health of persons in general dwelling or doing business nearby or passing along a public way.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes making the atmosphere noxious` IF
    ph's `voluntarily vitiates the atmosphere in any place so as to make it noxious to the health of persons in general dwelling or carrying on business in the neighbourhood or passing along a public way`

§§ `Sections 279 to 283 -- Ways and navigation`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 279"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes rash driving or riding on a public way under Penal Code 1871 section 279
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc Driving a vehicle or riding on a public way so rashly or negligently as to endanger human life or be likely to cause hurt or injury to another.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes rash driving or riding on a public way` IF
    ph's `drives a vehicle or rides on a public way in a manner so rash or negligent as to endanger human life or to be likely to cause hurt or injury to any other person`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 280"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes rash navigation of a vessel under Penal Code 1871 section 280
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc Navigating a vessel so rashly or negligently as to endanger human life or be likely to cause hurt or injury to another.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes rash navigation of a vessel` IF
    ph's `navigates a vessel in a manner so rash or negligent as to endanger human life or to be likely to cause hurt or injury to any other person`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 281"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes exhibiting a false light, mark or buoy under Penal Code 1871 section 281
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc Exhibiting a false light, mark or buoy, intending or knowing it likely to mislead a navigator.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes exhibiting a false light mark or buoy` IF
        ph's `exhibits a false light mark or buoy`
    AND ph's `intends or knows it to be likely that the exhibition will mislead a navigator`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 282"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes conveying a person by water for hire in an overloaded or unsafe vessel under Penal Code 1871 section 282
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc Knowingly or negligently conveying, or causing to be conveyed, a person for hire by water in a vessel so unsafe or so loaded as to endanger that person's life.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes conveying a person for hire in an unsafe vessel` IF
    ph's `knowingly or negligently conveys or causes to be conveyed for hire a person by water in a vessel which is in such a state or so loaded as to endanger the life of that person`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 283"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes danger or obstruction in a public way or line of navigation under Penal Code 1871 section 283
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc By an act, or by omitting to take order with property in one's possession or charge, causing danger, obstruction or injury to a person in a public way or public line of navigation.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes danger or obstruction in a public way` IF
    ph's `by doing an act or by omitting to take order with property in his possession or under his charge causes danger obstruction or injury to a person in a public way or public line of navigation`

§§ `Sections 284 to 289 -- Rash or negligent conduct with a dangerous substance, fire, machinery, a building or an animal`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 284"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes rash or negligent conduct with a dangerous or harmful substance under Penal Code 1871 section 284
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc A rash or negligent act with a dangerous or harmful substance (including fire), or an omission to guard against probable danger from one in one's possession, that is likely to cause hurt, endangers life, or causes hurt, grievous hurt or death.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes rash or negligent conduct with a dangerous substance` IF
        ph's `does with a dangerous or harmful substance including fire or anything likely to cause fire an act so rashly or negligently or omits to take such measure with such a substance in his possession as is sufficient to guard against probable danger to human life grievous hurt or hurt from it`
    AND (   ph's `the act or omission is likely to cause hurt or injury to any other person`
         OR ph's `the act or omission endangers human life`
         OR ph's `the act or omission causes hurt or injury to any other person`
         OR ph's `the act or omission causes grievous hurt to any other person`
         OR ph's `the act or omission causes the death of any other person`)

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 286"
@export Decide whether the person is presumed under Penal Code 1871 section 286 to have substantially contributed to the risk of a fire
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc Depositing, dropping, placing or throwing a cigarette, cigar, match, charcoal, incense, ember or anything likely to cause fire in a place where a fire occurs within 60 minutes, unless the contrary is proved.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the person is presumed to have substantially contributed to the risk of the fire` IF
        ph's `deposits drops places or throws a cigarette or part of one a cigar a match stick charcoal incense embers or anything likely to cause fire in a place and a fire occurs at that place or in its vicinity within 60 minutes of that act`
    AND NOT ph's `the contrary of the section 286 presumption is proved`

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 285"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes causing or contributing to the risk of a dangerous fire under Penal Code 1871 section 285
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc With fire or anything likely to cause fire, rashly or negligently causing or substantially contributing to the risk of a fire (or being presumed to under s 286), where a fire occurs and it is likely to cause hurt, endangers life, damages another's or the Government's property, or causes hurt, grievous hurt or death.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes causing or contributing to the risk of a dangerous fire` IF
        (   ph's `with fire or anything likely to cause fire rashly or negligently causes or substantially contributes to the risk of causing a fire`
         OR `the person is presumed to have substantially contributed to the risk of the fire` ph)
    AND ph's `a fire occurs`
    AND (   ph's `the act or omission is likely to cause hurt or injury to any other person`
         OR ph's `the act or omission endangers human life`
         OR ph's `the fire causes damage to or diminishes the value or utility of property belonging to any other person or the Government`
         OR ph's `the act or omission causes hurt or injury to any other person`
         OR ph's `the act or omission causes grievous hurt to any other person`
         OR ph's `the act or omission causes the death of any other person`)

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 287"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes rash or negligent conduct with machinery under Penal Code 1871 section 287
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc A rash or negligent act with machinery in one's possession or care, or an omission to guard against probable danger from it, that is likely to cause hurt, endangers life, or causes hurt, grievous hurt or death.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes rash or negligent conduct with machinery` IF
        ph's `does with machinery in his possession or under his care an act so rashly or negligently or omits to take such measure with such machinery as is sufficient to guard against probable danger to human life grievous hurt or hurt from it`
    AND (   ph's `the act or omission is likely to cause hurt or injury to any other person`
         OR ph's `the act or omission endangers human life`
         OR ph's `the act or omission causes hurt or injury to any other person`
         OR ph's `the act or omission causes grievous hurt to any other person`
         OR ph's `the act or omission causes the death of any other person`)

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 288"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes negligence in pulling down or repairing a building under Penal Code 1871 section 288
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc In pulling down or repairing a building, knowingly or negligently omitting to guard against probable danger to life from its fall, where the omission endangers life or causes death.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes negligence in pulling down or repairing a building` IF
        ph's `in pulling down or repairing a building knowingly or negligently omits to take such measure as is sufficient to guard against probable danger to human life from the fall of the building or any part of it`
    AND (   ph's `the act or omission endangers human life`
         OR ph's `the act or omission causes the death of any other person`)

@ref "Penal Code 1871, s 289"
@export Decide whether the act constitutes negligence with respect to an animal under Penal Code 1871 section 289
GIVEN ph IS A `Public Health And Safety` @desc Knowingly or negligently omitting to guard against probable danger to life or of grievous hurt from an animal, where the omission is likely to cause grievous hurt, endangers life, or causes grievous hurt or death.
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `constitutes negligence with respect to an animal` IF
        ph's `knowingly or negligently omits to take such measure with an animal as is sufficient to guard against probable danger to human life or probable danger of grievous hurt from the animal`
    AND (   ph's `the act or omission is likely to cause grievous hurt`
         OR ph's `the act or omission endangers human life`
         OR ph's `the act or omission causes grievous hurt to any other person`
         OR ph's `the act or omission causes the death of any other person`)

§§ `Proposed Act wrappers`

GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the proposed act constitutes an offence against public health` IF
        (   `constitutes a negligent act likely to spread infection` (a's `public health and safety`)
         OR `constitutes an intentional or rash act likely to spread infection` (a's `public health and safety`)
         OR `constitutes disobedience to a quarantine rule` (a's `public health and safety`)
         OR `constitutes adulterating food or drink for sale` (a's `public health and safety`)
         OR `constitutes selling noxious food or drink` (a's `public health and safety`)
         OR `constitutes adulterating drugs` (a's `public health and safety`)
         OR `constitutes selling adulterated drugs` (a's `public health and safety`)
         OR `constitutes selling a drug as a different drug` (a's `public health and safety`)
         OR `constitutes fouling a public spring or reservoir` (a's `public health and safety`)
         OR `constitutes making the atmosphere noxious` (a's `public health and safety`))
    AND NOT (`the act is taken outside offence by Chapter 4 or Chapter 4A` a)

GIVEN a IS A `Proposed Act`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the proposed act constitutes an offence against public safety` IF
        (   `constitutes rash driving or riding on a public way` (a's `public health and safety`)
         OR `constitutes rash navigation of a vessel` (a's `public health and safety`)
         OR `constitutes exhibiting a false light mark or buoy` (a's `public health and safety`)
         OR `constitutes conveying a person for hire in an unsafe vessel` (a's `public health and safety`)
         OR `constitutes danger or obstruction in a public way` (a's `public health and safety`)
         OR `constitutes rash or negligent conduct with a dangerous substance` (a's `public health and safety`)
         OR `constitutes causing or contributing to the risk of a dangerous fire` (a's `public health and safety`)
         OR `constitutes rash or negligent conduct with machinery` (a's `public health and safety`)
         OR `constitutes negligence in pulling down or repairing a building` (a's `public health and safety`)
         OR `constitutes negligence with respect to an animal` (a's `public health and safety`))
    AND NOT (`the act is taken outside offence by Chapter 4 or Chapter 4A` a)
